  "goodToKnow": "Der Konvoi is a convoy: ein Hilfskonvoi (aid convoy), ein Militärkonvoi, im Konvoi fahren. Originally, it meant escorted ships, such as WWII Atlantic convoys attacked by German U-boats. A close synonym for vehicles is die Kolonne. Pronounced KON-voy or kon-VOY. From French convoi. Plural: die Konvois."
